From: Fusion OS <noreply@fusion-os>
Subject: [PATCH] SpvBuilder.h: include <cstdint>

GCC 13+ no longer pulls <cstdint> in transitively, so uint32_t is
undeclared and host-python-glslang fails to build on current hosts.
Same fix as upstream glslang (later releases include <cstdint>).

Signed-off-by: Fusion OS <noreply@fusion-os>
---
diff --git a/SPIRV/SpvBuilder.h b/SPIRV/SpvBuilder.h
index b75eab8..d7d6edd 100644
--- a/SPIRV/SpvBuilder.h
+++ b/SPIRV/SpvBuilder.h
@@ -56,6 +56,7 @@ namespace spv {
 }
 
 #include <algorithm>
+#include <cstdint>
 #include <map>
 #include <memory>
 #include <set>
